  "text_sanskrit": "उत्क्रामन्तं स्थितं वापि भुञ्जानं वा गुणान्वितम् । विमूढा नानुपश्यन्ति पश्यन्ति ज्ञानचक्षुषः ॥ १५-१० ॥",
  "itrans": "utkrAmantaM sthitaM vApi bhu~njAnaM vA guNAnvitam . vimUDhA nAnupashyanti pashyanti j~nAnachakShuShaH .. 15-10 ..",
  "translation": "Departing, or standing within, or enjoying only what is excellent-Him the deluded do not perceive; those endowed with the eve of wisdom do see. (10.)\nV. Gunanvita: united to excellence that which is excellent. The deluded: furnishes the reason for their not perceiving Him.\nA. How is it that perception does not arise in spite of the efforts made ?",
